sequenceDiagram
    participant User as User / Kubeflow
    participant Pod as Training Pod
    participant THub as Training Hub
    participant TorchRun as torchrun Workers
    participant HF as HuggingFace Hub<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant FS as Local Filesystem / PVC
    participant S3 as S3-Compatible Storage<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant LLM as OpenAI-Compatible API<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant MLflow as MLflow Server

    rect rgb(230, 245, 230)
        Note over User,S3: Flow 1: SFT / OSFT Training
        User->>Pod: Submit training job
        Pod->>THub: sft() / osft() via Python API or thub CLI
        THub->>HF: Download model + dataset<br/>HTTPS / Bearer token (optional)
        HF-->>THub: Model weights + tokenizer + dataset
        THub->>TorchRun: Launch torchrun with serialized callbacks<br/>(inspect.getsource + base64)
        TorchRun->>TorchRun: NCCL/Gloo inter-worker communication
        TorchRun->>FS: Save checkpoints<br/>(checkpoint-{step} / full_state)
        TorchRun->>S3: Mirror checkpoints (background LIFO upload)<br/>HTTPS / AWS IAM
        TorchRun-->>THub: Training complete
        THub->>FS: Write training_metrics.jsonl<br/>(for Kubeflow progress)
        THub-->>Pod: Return model path
    end

    rect rgb(230, 235, 250)
        Note over User,S3: Flow 2: GRPO Training (verl backend)
        User->>Pod: Submit GRPO training job
        Pod->>THub: grpo() with verl backend
        THub->>THub: Assemble 50+ Hydra CLI overrides
        THub->>TorchRun: Launch verl.trainer.main_ppo subprocess
        TorchRun->>HF: Download model<br/>HTTPS / Bearer token
        HF-->>TorchRun: Model weights
        TorchRun->>TorchRun: FSDP workers + vLLM rollout engine<br/>(shared memory, NCCL)
        TorchRun->>FS: Save checkpoints
        TorchRun-->>THub: Training complete
    end

    rect rgb(250, 240, 230)
        Note over User,MLflow: Flow 3: GEPA Prompt Optimization
        User->>Pod: Submit GEPA optimization
        Pod->>THub: gepa() via Python API or thub CLI
        loop Evolutionary search iterations
            THub->>LLM: Generate prompt candidates<br/>HTTPS / Bearer (OPENAI_API_KEY)
            LLM-->>THub: LLM responses
            THub->>THub: Pareto selection + LLM reflection
        end
        THub->>FS: Save optimized prompts
        THub->>MLflow: Log experiment + register prompt<br/>HTTP/HTTPS
    end

    rect rgb(250, 230, 230)
        Note over Pod,S3: Flow 4: JIT Preemption Checkpoint
        Note right of Pod: Kubernetes sends SIGTERM<br/>(pod preemption / eviction)
        Pod-->>THub: SIGTERM signal
        THub->>THub: Set preemption flag<br/>(no logging - deadlock avoidance)
        THub->>TorchRun: all_reduce(MAX) rank coordination
        TorchRun->>FS: Save checkpoint at next step boundary
        TorchRun->>S3: Upload checkpoint (hardlink staging)<br/>HTTPS / AWS credentials
        Note right of S3: LIFO: newest checkpoint uploads first
    end
